[I] Material Design theme for GNOME/GTK desktops

[T] Materia is a Material Design theme for GNOME/GTK based desktop
[T] environments. It supports GTK 2, 3 and 4, GNOME Shell, Cinnamon, MATE,
[T] Xfce and others, with color and size variants.

